      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEZA PUNK ROCKER NZ (5) won at this track two runs ago before finishing third at his latest appearance over 1660m at this track, beaten 7 metres. Meets a comparable field and he can get back to the winner's list. WHOS DELIGHT NZ (7) finished fifth two runs ago then broke and finished a distant last over 2138m at this track at the latest appearance. Has to contend with a very wide draw. Must improve his manners but a return to form is on the cards. JUNGLE DRAGON (3) finished second last start over 1660m at this track. Generally runs very well at this circuit so can play a big role. BLUTO NZ (8) won two runs back then his luck changed last time when he broke and finished a long way back in sixth over 1660m at this track. Shouldn't spend a penny from this draw and the sprint lane may come in handy. It doesn't get any easier but he is talented enough to be competitive.",
